# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Media that must never reach a public repository
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  This repository becomes public when it is deployed to GitHub Pages. Raw
#  capture files are both too large for GitHub (100 MB hard limit per file)
#  and, for employer work, not yours to publish. Video belongs on YouTube as
#  an unlisted upload, referenced by id. See README -> Video hosting.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wmv

#  Source archives of company material, in case one is ever dropped in here.
Portfolio_Preparation/
*.zip
!src/assets/**/*.zip
